    "whatItIs": "Kinsta is managed WordPress (and adjacent app) hosting on Google Cloud — a hosting-providers peer of WP Engine and Cloudways, not a Plesk/cPanel panel licence. Single 20GB publishes from $35/month as the ongoing floor; promotional first-month offers appear on marketing pages and must not replace $35 as the research floor. Free migrations are commonly offered; there is no general free trial. WP Engine remains the cluster award (7.7); this entity does not outrank it. Landscape-only versus Plesk.",
